{
    "openapi": "3.0.0",
    "info": {
        "title": "TempoFast API",
        "description": "## TempoFast — API Documentation\n\nThis API supports **two authentication modes**:\n\n### 1. Standalone Mode (Email/Password)\n- `POST /api/v1/auth/register` — Register a new account\n- `POST /api/v1/auth/login` — Login with email & password\n- `POST /api/v1/auth/logout` — Logout\n- `GET  /api/v1/auth/user` — Get current user\n\n### 2. Console SSO Mode (OAuth2)\n- User is redirected to DXS Console for authentication\n- After login, frontend receives an authorization code\n- `POST /api/v1/auth/sso/callback` — Exchange code for tokens\n- `POST /api/v1/auth/sso/logout` — Logout & revoke Console tokens\n- `GET  /api/v1/auth/sso/user` — Get current user with organizations\n\n### Authentication\nAll protected endpoints require a Bearer token:\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer {token}\n```\n\nFor **Standalone mode**, obtain the token from login/register (pass `device_name`).\nFor **Console SSO mode**, obtain the token from SSO callback (pass `device_name`).\n\nWithout `device_name`, session-based authentication is used (cookie).\n\n### Multi-Tenancy Headers (Console SSO mode)\nProtected endpoints may require:\n```\nX-Organization-Id: {organization_slug}    # Required\nX-Branch-Id: {branch_uuid}                # Optional\n```",
        "contact": {
            "name": "TempoFast"
        },
        "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    "servers": [
        {
            "url": "http://localhost:5400",
            "description": "Local Development"
        }
    ],
    "paths": {
        "/api/v1/auth/login": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Auth — Standalone"
                ],
                "summary": "Login with email & password",
                "description": "Authenticate a user with email and password (standalone mode).\n\n**With `device_name`**: Returns a Sanctum API token for mobile/SPA apps.\n**Without `device_name`**: Creates a session (cookie-based auth for web).",
                "operationId": "c99bdfd067de5ad8950a4ef4cbef1406",
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "required": [
                                    "email",
                                    "password"
                                ],
                                "properties": {
                                    "email": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "email",
                                        "example": "user@example.com"
                                    },
                                    "password": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "password",
                                        "example": "password123"
                                    },
                                    "device_name": {
                                        "description": "Device name for API token auth. Omit for session/cookie auth.",
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "example": "iPhone 15",
                                        "nullable": true
                                    }
                                },
                                "type": "object"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Login successful",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "data": {
                                            "properties": {
                                                "user": {
                                                    "properties": {
                                                        "id": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "uuid",
                                                            "example": "019d4e6a-1234-7abc-def0-123456789abc"
                                                        },
                                                        "email": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "email",
                                                            "example": "user@example.com"
                                                        },
                                                        "name": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "example": "田中 太郎"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "type": "object"
                                                },
                                                "token": {
                                                    "description": "Sanctum API token (only returned when device_name is provided)",
                                                    "type": "string",
                                                    "example": "1|abc123xyz...",
                                                    "nullable": true
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "type": "object"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Invalid credentials",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "error": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "INVALID_CREDENTIALS"
                                        },
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "The provided credentials are incorrect."
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "403": {
                        "description": "Account disabled",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "error": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "ACCOUNT_DISABLED"
                                        },
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "Your account has been disabled."
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation error",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "The email field is required."
                                        },
                                        "errors": {
                                            "type": "object",
                                            "example": "{\"email\": [\"The email field is required.\"]}"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/auth/register": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Auth — Standalone"
                ],
                "summary": "Register a new account",
                "description": "Create a new user account (standalone mode only).\n\nThis endpoint may be disabled via configuration (`dxs-sso.standalone.registration = false`).\n\n**With `device_name`**: Returns a Sanctum API token.\n**Without `device_name`**: Creates a session (cookie-based auth).",
                "operationId": "17ef4c276b0f125a91a8356a1d7e1ea5",
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "required": [
                                    "name",
                                    "email",
                                    "password",
                                    "password_confirmation"
                                ],
                                "properties": {
                                    "name": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "maxLength": 255,
                                        "example": "田中 太郎"
                                    },
                                    "email": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "email",
                                        "maxLength": 255,
                                        "example": "user@example.com"
                                    },
                                    "password": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "password",
                                        "minLength": 8,
                                        "example": "password123"
                                    },
                                    "password_confirmation": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "password",
                                        "example": "password123"
                                    },
                                    "device_name": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "example": "iPhone 15",
                                        "nullable": true
                                    }
                                },
                                "type": "object"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "201": {
                        "description": "Registration successful",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "data": {
                                            "properties": {
                                                "user": {
                                                    "properties": {
                                                        "id": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "uuid"
                                                        },
                                                        "email": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "email"
                                                        },
                                                        "name": {
                                                            "type": "string"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "type": "object"
                                                },
                                                "token": {
                                                    "type": "string",
                                                    "nullable": true
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "type": "object"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation error (duplicate email, weak password, etc.)",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string"
                                        },
                                        "errors": {
                                            "type": "object"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/auth/logout": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Auth — Standalone"
                ],
                "summary": "Logout",
                "description": "Logout the current user.\n\n- **Bearer token auth**: Revokes the current API token only (other device tokens remain active).\n- **Session auth**: Destroys the session.",
                "operationId": "701698ad6a92079bfcb81ed22d4d02fc",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Logged out successfully",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "Logged out successfully"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Unauthenticated"
                    }
                },
                "security": [
                    {
                        "sanctum": []
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/auth/user": {
            "get": {
                "tags": [
                    "Auth — Standalone"
                ],
                "summary": "Get current user",
                "description": "Returns the authenticated user's profile information.",
                "operationId": "ac428264909ac726eb44134f36d83e29",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "User info",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "data": {
                                            "properties": {
                                                "user": {
                                                    "properties": {
                                                        "id": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "uuid"
                                                        },
                                                        "email": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "email"
                                                        },
                                                        "name": {
                                                            "type": "string"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "type": "object"
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "type": "object"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Unauthenticated"
                    }
                },
                "security": [
                    {
                        "sanctum": []
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/auth/sso/callback": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Auth — SSO"
                ],
                "summary": "SSO callback — exchange code for tokens",
                "description": "Exchange an OAuth2 authorization code (from DXS Console redirect) for authentication tokens.\n\n### Flow\n1. User authenticates on DXS Console\n2. Console redirects to your app with `?code=AUTH_CODE`\n3. Frontend sends the code to this endpoint\n4. Backend exchanges code → verifies JWT → creates/updates user → returns auth\n\n### Auth Modes\n- **With `device_name`**: Returns a Sanctum API token for mobile/SPA.\n- **Without `device_name`**: Creates a session (cookie-based auth).\n\n### Side Effects\n- Creates or updates user in local database from JWT claims\n- Stores encrypted Console tokens for API proxy\n- Syncs organizations, branches, and role assignments from Console",
                "operationId": "fca4cdc8a1e13e8fd69b50b86d01588f",
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "required": [
                                    "code"
                                ],
                                "properties": {
                                    "code": {
                                        "description": "Authorization code from Console SSO redirect",
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "example": "dxs_auth_abc123xyz"
                                    },
                                    "device_name": {
                                        "description": "Device name for API token auth. Omit for session/cookie auth.",
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "example": "iPhone 15",
                                        "nullable": true
                                    }
                                },
                                "type": "object"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Authentication successful",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "data": {
                                            "properties": {
                                                "user": {
                                                    "description": "Authenticated user",
                                                    "properties": {
                                                        "id": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "uuid",
                                                            "example": "019d4e6a-1234-7abc-def0-123456789abc"
                                                        },
                                                        "console_user_id": {
                                                            "description": "User ID from Console SSO",
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "uuid"
                                                        },
                                                        "console_organization_id": {
                                                            "description": "Primary organization ID",
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "uuid",
                                                            "nullable": true
                                                        },
                                                        "email": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "email",
                                                            "example": "user@example.com"
                                                        },
                                                        "name": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "example": "田中 太郎"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "type": "object"
                                                },
                                                "organizations": {
                                                    "description": "Organizations the user has access to",
                                                    "type": "array",
                                                    "items": {
                                                        "properties": {
                                                            "organization_id": {
                                                                "type": "string",
                                                                "format": "uuid"
                                                            },
                                                            "organization_slug": {
                                                                "type": "string",
                                                                "example": "famgia"
                                                            },
                                                            "organization_name": {
                                                                "type": "string",
                                                                "example": "Famgia"
                                                            },
                                                            "organization_role": {
                                                                "type": "string",
                                                                "example": "admin"
                                                            },
                                                            "service_role": {
                                                                "type": "string",
                                                                "example": "admin",
                                                                "nullable": true
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        "type": "object"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                "token": {
                                                    "description": "Sanctum API token (only when device_name provided)",
                                                    "type": "string",
                                                    "example": "1|abc123xyz...",
                                                    "nullable": true
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "type": "object"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Invalid authorization code or JWT token",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "error": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "enum": [
                                                "INVALID_CODE",
                                                "INVALID_TOKEN"
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation error",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string"
                                        },
                                        "errors": {
                                            "type": "object"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/auth/sso/logout": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Auth — SSO"
                ],
                "summary": "SSO Logout",
                "description": "Logout the current SSO user.\n\n- Revokes Console access & refresh tokens (calls Console revoke API)\n- Deletes current Sanctum API token (if Bearer auth)\n- Destroys session (if session auth)",
                "operationId": "ab501819c8aa4652d767955e7880852c",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Logged out successfully",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "Logged out successfully"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Unauthenticated"
                    }
                },
                "security": [
                    {
                        "sanctum": []
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/auth/sso/user": {
            "get": {
                "tags": [
                    "Auth — SSO"
                ],
                "summary": "Get current SSO user",
                "description": "Returns the authenticated SSO user's profile and their accessible organizations with roles.",
                "operationId": "acd79e4b0590c527c6921347ed027086",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "User info with organizations",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "data": {
                                            "properties": {
                                                "user": {
                                                    "properties": {
                                                        "id": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "uuid"
                                                        },
                                                        "console_user_id": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "uuid"
                                                        },
                                                        "console_organization_id": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "uuid",
                                                            "nullable": true
                                                        },
                                                        "email": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "email"
                                                        },
                                                        "name": {
                                                            "type": "string"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "type": "object"
                                                },
                                                "organizations": {
                                                    "type": "array",
                                                    "items": {
                                                        "properties": {
                                                            "organization_id": {
                                                                "type": "string",
                                                                "format": "uuid"
                                                            },
                                                            "organization_slug": {
                                                                "type": "string"
                                                            },
                                                            "organization_name": {
                                                                "type": "string"
                                                            },
                                                            "organization_role": {
                                                                "type": "string"
                                                            },
                                                            "service_role": {
                                                                "type": "string",
                                                                "nullable": true
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        "type": "object"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "type": "object"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Unauthenticated"
                    }
                },
                "security": [
                    {
                        "sanctum": []
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/auth/webhook/cache-purge": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Webhook"
                ],
                "summary": "Purge SSO caches (webhook)",
                "description": "Called by DXS Console when roles, permissions, or JWKS keys change.\n\nClears:\n- JWKS public key cache (forces re-fetch on next JWT verification)\n- Organization access cache for specified user/org\n\n### Authentication\nRequires `X-Omnify-Signature` header with HMAC-SHA256 of request body,\nsigned with `SSO_SERVICE_SECRET`.",
                "operationId": "74a4ad60f450a6ada0e8c0bf06186cdc",
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "properties": {
                                    "organization_id": {
                                        "description": "Organization to clear cache for",
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "uuid"
                                    },
                                    "user_id": {
                                        "description": "Specific user to clear cache for",
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "uuid",
                                        "nullable": true
                                    }
                                },
                                "type": "object"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Cache cleared",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "status": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "cleared"
                                        },
                                        "organization_id": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "format": "uuid",
                                            "nullable": true
                                        },
                                        "user_id": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "format": "uuid",
                                            "nullable": true
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "403": {
                        "description": "Invalid webhook signature",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "error": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "Invalid webhook signature"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    },
    "components": {
        "securitySchemes": {
            "sanctum": {
                "type": "http",
                "description": "Bearer token from login or SSO callback",
                "scheme": "bearer",
                "bearerFormat": "Token"
            }
        }
    },
    "tags": [
        {
            "name": "Auth — Standalone",
            "description": "Email/password authentication (standalone mode)"
        },
        {
            "name": "Auth — SSO",
            "description": "Console SSO authentication (console mode)"
        },
        {
            "name": "Webhook",
            "description": "Console webhook endpoints"
        }
    ]
}